## Installation

<InstallCommand
  pnpm="pnpm add @coss-sv/ui"
  shadcnSvelte="pnpm dlx shadcn-svelte@latest add https://coss-sv.vercel.app/r/command.json"
/>

## Usage

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
  import * as Command from "@coss-sv/ui/components/ui/command";
</script>

<Command.DialogRoot>
  <Command.DialogTrigger>Open Command Palette</Command.DialogTrigger>
  <Command.DialogPopup>
    <Command.Root items={groups}>
      <Command.Input placeholder="Search for apps and commands..." />
      <Command.Panel>
        <Command.Empty>No results found.</Command.Empty>
        <Command.List />
      </Command.Panel>
    </Command.Root>
  </Command.DialogPopup>
</Command.DialogRoot>
```

## API Reference

### Command.Root

Autocomplete-backed command state with command-palette defaults.

### Command.DialogRoot

The Shards dialog root used by modal command palettes.

### Command.DialogTrigger

Opens the command dialog.

### Command.DialogPopup

Displays the command palette inside a dialog.

### Command.Input

Search input with its integrated search icon.

### Command.List

Scrollable command items.

### Command.Panel

Styled command content container.

### Command.Empty

Shown when no commands match.

### Command.Group

Groups related commands.

### Command.GroupLabel

Labels a command group.

### Command.Item

An individual command.

### Command.Separator

Separates command groups.

### Command.Shortcut

Displays a keyboard shortcut.

### Command.Footer

Displays command hints.

### Command.Collection

Renders filtered commands through a typed snippet.

## Examples

### With Keyboard Shortcut

Add a document keydown listener and toggle the bound dialog `open` state.

### With Grouped Items

Pass grouped items to `Command.Root`, then render each group with `Command.Collection`.

### Standalone Command (Without Dialog)

Use `Command.Root` with `Command.Panel` when a modal dialog is not needed.
